{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"s392bc24e98cd6caf","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-900ee9f9bd769ef49b97","text":"あの火を見た？どれくらいの頻度で燃えているのかしら？","speaker":"観炎虫"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-39d9c54be63710885a11","text":"2秒？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-01175b34b0cb699f53eb","text":"4秒？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-051aa5b6fec039d4f024","text":"8秒？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-5b78e0a3041aba865819","text":"そんなに真剣に答えてくれてありがとう。答えは——私も知らないわ。だって、そもそも数える指がないからカサ！","speaker":"観炎虫"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-b9fcb23f096da904aae1","text":"あの火を見た？どれくらいの頻度で燃えているのかしら？","speaker":"観炎虫"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-23e111b77178c74632f4","text":"2秒？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-4cb650f066e15d0b5e49","text":"4秒？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-36ae86381f1a369226c2","text":"8秒？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-bd349521a0364b645c66","text":"火なんてないんだけど？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-ce15276991b274180f8f","text":"え！本当に消えてる。大凶の兆しよ！なんでこんなことになっているカサ……","speaker":"観炎虫"}]}
